Package: evoice
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Damien Volkov <58026317+damvolkov@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libasound2t64 | libasound2, espeak-ng, ca-certificates
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/edamlabs/e-voice
Description: CPU-first speech services: streaming STT and TTS, voice daemon and CLI
 Streaming speech-to-text with emotion on every segment (e-voice) and streaming
 text-to-speech that speaks in a learned voice (e-voice-tts), behind
 OpenAI-compatible APIs; the local voice daemon with MCP (evoiced) and the
 terminal client (ecli). Runs as systemd user units: evoice-stt, evoice-tts,
 evoiced.
